    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU throttling: backend and Postgres",
      "description": "Share of CFS periods in which the container hit its CPU limit and was paused. graph-storage runs inside the backend process, so its query building and result decoding are throttled with the backend. Above 0.25 requests slow down regardless of what Postgres does; throttling on `postgres` slows every database on the cluster.",
